{"id":"n1-119","title":"Verb ずとも","romaji":"〜zu tomo","jlptLevel":1,"shortExplanation":"Means 'Even without doing (X), (Y) can still happen'.","longExplanation":"The ～ずとも grammar point is used to express that, even if something isn't done, the desired result can still be achieved or the situation remains unaffected. It can be translated as 'even without' or 'even if not'.","formation":"Verb-negative stem + ずとも","examples":[{"jp":"朝ごはんを食べずとも、働くことができます。","romaji":"Asagohan o tabezu tomo, hataraku koto ga dekimasu.","en":"Even without eating breakfast, I can work.","words":[{"surface":"朝","vocabId":"1428280","reading":"あさ"},{"surface":"ごはん","vocabId":"1270590","reading":"ごはん"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"食べ","vocabId":"1358280","reading":"たべる","baseForm":"食べる"},{"surface":"ず","vocabId":null,"baseForm":"ぬ"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"働く","vocabId":"1451150","reading":"はたらく"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき","baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[4,5]},{"jp":"車がなくとも、バスで行くことができます。","romaji":"Kuruma ga nakutomo, basu de iku koto ga dekimasu.","en":"Even without a car, you can go by bus.","words":[{"surface":"車","vocabId":"1323080","reading":"くるま"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なく","vocabId":"1229840","reading":"なく","baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"バス","vocabId":null},{"surface":"で","vocabId":null},{"surface":"行く","vocabId":"1578850","reading":"いく"},{"surface":"こと","vocabId":"1313580","reading":"こと"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"でき","vocabId":"1340430","reading":"でき","baseForm":"できる"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[]},{"jp":"お金がなくとも、幸せになれる。","romaji":"Okane ga nakutomo, shiawase ni nareru.","en":"Even without money, one can be happy.","words":[{"surface":"お金","vocabId":"1001820","reading":"おかね"},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なく","vocabId":"1229840","reading":"なく","baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"幸せ","vocabId":"1594060","reading":"しあわせ"},{"surface":"に","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なれる","vocabId":"1212670","reading":"なれる"},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[]},{"jp":"インターネットがなくとも、情報を得る方法はいくつかあります。","romaji":"Intānetto ga nakutomo, jōhō o eru hōhō wa ikutsu ka arimasu.","en":"Even without the internet, there are several ways to obtain information.","words":[{"surface":"インターネット","vocabId":null},{"surface":"が","vocabId":null},{"surface":"なく","vocabId":"1229840","reading":"なく","baseForm":"ない"},{"surface":"とも","vocabId":null},{"surface":"、","vocabId":null},{"surface":"情報","vocabId":"1356370","reading":"じょうほう"},{"surface":"を","vocabId":null},{"surface":"得る","vocabId":"1588760","reading":"える"},{"surface":"方法","vocabId":"1517090","reading":"ほうほう"},{"surface":"は","vocabId":null},{"surface":"いくつ","vocabId":"1219960","reading":"いくつ"},{"surface":"か","vocabId":null},{"surface":"あり","vocabId":"1225940","reading":"あり","baseForm":"ある"},{"surface":"ます","vocabId":null},{"surface":"。","vocabId":null}],"patternWordIndices":[]}]}